# Generated files — Prettier must not rewrite these.
#
# `lint-staged` runs `prettier --write` over `*.{json,md}`, which would reformat
# a generated document on every commit that touches it. The generator would then
# undo that on its next run, so the file would flip between two formattings
# forever and every regeneration would carry thousands of lines of pure noise.
# The fix is to leave generated output exactly as its generator emits it.

# Rendered from Base.metadata by backend/scripts/generate_schema_docs.py
docs/DATABASE_SCHEMA.md

